{"id":1958,"level":80,"name":"Завоювання простору з темпом (2)","group":"Завоювання простору з темпом","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Gaining space is essential, but when combined with an attack or threat, it can be done with tempo. Gaining space with tempo means simultaneously improving your position and forcing your opponent to react. In this lesson, this means advancing a pawn while attacking a piece at the same time.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":99,"examples":[{"fen":"r1bq1rk1/pppn1pbp/3p1np1/4p3/3P4/1P3NP1/PBPNPPBP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 0 8","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,16,-23]} 8... e4 * ","text":"<p>Чорні захоплюють простір у центрі й водночас відтісняють білого коня на пасивне поле.</p><p><br></p><h6><br></h6><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp3pbp/2np1np1/4p3/3PP3/2NBBP2/PP2N1PP/R2QK2R w KQ - 0 10","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,60,89]} 10. d5 * ","text":"<p>Білі знімають напругу, просуваючи пішака d і атакуючи чорного коня. Це звільняє простір і збільшує контроль над дошкою.</p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":75981,"fen":"r2r2k1/2q1bppp/p1np1nb1/1p2p3/2pPP3/2P1B1P1/PP1N1PBP/N1RQR1K1 w - - 0 16","pgn":"{[%csl Gd4][%evp 0,1,31,36]} {Q=1} 16. d5 * ","format":27,"texts":["Здобувайте простір за допомогою темпу."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75992,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp2ppbp/2np1np1/6B1/2PP4/2N2N2/PP2BPPP/R2QK2R w KQ - 0 9","pgn":"{[%csl Gd4][%evp 0,1,32,27]} {Q=1} 9. d5 * ","format":27,"texts":["Здобувайте простір за допомогою темпу."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75987,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp2ppbp/1nnp2p1/8/2PP4/1PN1B3/P4PPP/2RQKBNR w K - 0 10","pgn":"{[%csl Gd4][%evp 0,1,37,46]} {Q=1} 10. d5 * ","format":27,"texts":["Здобувайте простір за допомогою темпу."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75990,"fen":"r1bqkb1r/pp3ppp/2n2n2/3pp3/2P5/2N1P3/PPN2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 7","pgn":"{[%csl Gd5][%evp 0,3,-163,-166,-152,-107]} {Q=1} 7... d4 8. exd4 {Q=2} exd4 * ","